(text "RECEIVER DEFAULTS\n10k pull resistors are connected to the receiver\nsupply or GND; CS defaults HIGH. GPIO5 boot strap remains pulled HIGH." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e93fac07-4004-595d-822c-37611b3f9f18"))
(text "Ioff <=10uA with VCC=0; 10k +1% bounds pull-down rise to0.101V per output.\nAt VCC>=3.0V and <=0.36mA load, check ADS VIH=0.8*DVDD using the actual module DVDD.\n33 ohm output damping is a starting layout value; verify SPI waveform/timing on hardware.\nEach100nF capacitor belongs next to its respective U50/U51/U52 supply pins." (at 25.4 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "16aa38f0-b836-506e-b1ea-247adc353b8e"))
